vfj5 mutation — `git status` on `ci.yml` and `Makefile` is empty.\n\nPreserved and re-verified: manifest `b6f56aac…04c`, tree `e6a13215…2fae` over 448 files, 3 modified / 354 untracked, pin `00b1688a` at `ci.yml:28`/`:81`.\n\n**One thing the reviewer should know:** `task-board handoff` failed closed again (exit 1) on items 13 and 15. Both are *correctly* unchecked — 13 was reconciled as N/A by the board owner, 15 is the reviewer's own gate. I set `to-review` explicitly, as the owner note anticipates. This is the third occurrence of the append-only-checklist constraint; D7-a is still the open class fix.","ttft_ms":1935,"ttft_stream_ms":1409,"time_to_request_ms":17,"type":"result","duration_ms":1476788,"uuid":"291d7644-06da-450d-b7f3-9d27d5b1cdfe"}
